// EXPECT_COMPILE_ERROR E_CODEGEN_TYPE_UNKNOWN
//
// Реестр 221.1 №401 ("ПЕРЕОТКРЫТ", окно p401b-p67-class): negative pin for
// the `[P67-LEGACY]`→honest-error class. Стартовый носитель интегратора —
// минута: `Io.write_out("")` bound to `ro`, БЕЗ `import std.io`.
//
// `nova check` PASSES this file (the checker's `Type.method(...)` Path-call
// arm — `types/mod.rs` ~14625, gated on `method_overloads` — silently
// `return`s when it finds no overload for an unimported receiver; the same
// documented, deliberately-not-fixed gap as реестр №81, revert reason:
// a blanket "type not imported" diagnostic there regressed `nova check
// std/src` by 42 files on legitimate cross-module const/intrinsic-namespace
// Path-calls). Before this window, codegen's legacy `infer_call_ret_c`
// (`emit_c.rs`, Path-call branch) hit exactly that same silence — no
// `resolved_types`/`resolved_callees` entry, no `effect_schemas["Io"]`
// entry either (that registry is built ONLY from types actually present in
// this compile unit, and `Io`'s declaration lives in `std.io`, never
// imported here) — and PANICKED (`nova: internal error ... [P67-LEGACY]
// Path call return type unknown for method=write_out ... This is a bug in
// nova. Please report it.`), aborting the WHOLE process — fatal to a
// `nova test <dir>` BATCH, not just this one file (реестр №401, "цена").
//
// This window did NOT resolve the underlying §0 gap (still requires
// `import std.io` to actually compile — see the sibling POSITIVE case,
// `spec_tests/conformance/standalone/…` for a WITH-import carrier of the
// same Path-call channel). It replaced the internal-error PANIC with an
// honest, coded compile-error (`fatal_codegen_type_unknown`, `emit_c.rs`)
// that (a) does not claim "this is a bug in nova" for what is, in this
// carrier's case, an ordinary missing import, and (b) is now caught by
// `nova_codegen::test_runner::catch_unit_panic` (wraps both the `nova
// test` per-unit compile call and `nova build`'s `emit_module_multi_tu`
// call) — a panic here no longer kills a multi-file batch, it becomes an
// ordinary per-unit `FAIL`/`error:` outcome. Ratchet: `nova check std/src`
// FAIL count must not move (this class was already checker-silent before
// this window; nothing here changes checker behavior).

module neg.m221_401_path_call_unimported_effect_neg

fn main() Io -> () {
    ro _a = Io.write_out("")
}
